This is how my macros should be pasting:

• \nSubset: ⋐̸ (U+22D0 U+0338)
• \cong: ≅ (U+2245)
• \ncong: ≇ (U+2247)
• \bigcup: ⋃ (U+22C3)
• \notin: ∉ (U+2209)
• \neq: ≠ (U+2260)
• \llbracket: ⟦ (U+27E6); \rrbracket: ⟧ (U+27E7)
• \llparenthesis: (|; \rrparenthesis: |)
